 (pods, pods/log follow, secrets, events), the Pod and per-job Secret builder (decisions 3 and 10: init/agent/sidecar layout, emptyDir sizes, securityContext, labels, owner reference, lowercased ULID names), and the executor: Prepare (workspace + pack + key), Start, Status mapping (Prepared, Running, Orphaned when the key is not held, Exited from `containerStatuses` with `.done`, TimedOut, Gone without upload), Logs (follow into `h.LogPath`), Kill, Cleanup (pod, Secret, key, dirs), Prune. Table tests against the fake for the spec (no key in the agent container, no SA token) and every state transition.\n\n**Design:** [#54 design comment](https://github.com/albertcbrown/ard/issues/54#issuecomment-7131825898) (owner-approved). **Size:** L. **Who:** worker.\n**Part of:** #54\n**Depends on:** #313, #314, #315","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_013JcRBF8VsdQ1HrpuYRPgjm","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
